        "original_id": "6346cd71-698a-537b-b87a-7050fe72f71c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Neringa Municipality, Pervalka, Curonian Spit, Curonian Lagoon, Baltic Sea, Lithuania, Klaipėda County\n- Systems: Municipalities of Lithuania, elderships\n- Products: Pervalka Lighthouse\n\nFacts:\n- Lithuania is divided into 60 municipalities, and those municipalities are further divided into more than 500 elderships.\n- Neringa Municipality is a municipality in Klaipėda County in the westernmost part of Lithuania.\n- Neringa Municipality comprises several villages on the Curonian Spit.\n- Pervalka is administratively part of the city of Neringa.\n- Pervalka Lighthouse is located in Pervalka on the Curonian Spit in Lithuania.\n- Pervalka Lighthouse stands between the Curonian Lagoon to the east and the Baltic Sea to the west.",
